IPTSAT initially focused its activities in the field of Geographical Information Systems, GIS, (SILVER Business Partner of ESRI Product) through assistance, turnkey systems and projects for natural resources management. The experience acquired through the development of GIS solution, allows the company staff to co-operate and support all organisations and decision makers involved in the management, optimization and correct development of natural and geographic resources. 
Since the 2000s the company has developed skills in the field of satellite remote se, Earth Observation and professional training of technicians in the area. 
In the field of the GIS and remote Sensing, the company provides turnkey solutions, adapted to the customers needs for the management of the environment as follows:

• Acquisition and management of small, medium and large scale cartography;
• Production of Digital Elevation Models (dem, dsm, dtm);
• Thematic maps production;
• Identification and estimation of changes due to urban and/or industrial development 
• Management of technological networks (oil, gas, water, electricity)
• Urban plan management ;
• Estimation of environmental impact;
• Development of gis and webgis systems (business partner of Esri)
• Satellite data and emote sensing processing and analysis;
• development of monitoring systems;
• Consultancies on projects, applications and advanced systems;
• training courses activity.
• Agriculture and Forestry estimations in terms of production and monitoring of the health of vegetation;
Our company also offers the following services:
• distribution of satellite data 
• data interpretation and classification;
• turnkey HW-SW solutions;
• geocoding and vectorialization of the data;
• Consultancyand spcific training (ESRI Software, Database, Open source solution)

About us: Orbital Africa is one of the leading Geospatial consulting companies registered under the laws of Kenya to offer and deliver wide-range of Geospatial solutions as well as services within Kenya and Eastern Africa region at large. Orbital is founded by a group of professionals and experts with past and proven skills and experience in realm of Geospatial Applications development & deployment.

Services & Solutions we offer include:
- GIS and RS projects as well as training (GIS, ERDAS, ENVI, Drone Mapping etc);
- Geospatial Database Development (includes enterprise database solutions i.e. PostgeSQL, MySQL, SDE, Oracle Spatial etc);
- Web mapping applications development (ArcGIS Server, GeoServer & MapServer); 
- Spatial planning (landuse and intelligent urban transport planning); 
- Land Surveying and mapping solutions;
- 3D Urban Planning and Mapping (using city engine; Google Sketchup pro; We also capture process 3D LiDAR & Laser data). 

At Orbital Africa, we offer consultancy services in realm of aerial mapping using m?Drones/UAV technology. To augment data delivery, mapping and consultancy work, we offer proven GIS & remote sensing training services to our clients as well as technical support.

Our clients: National & county governments, NGOs, transportation & utility industries, energy industry, agriculture, educational institutions, surveying and construction, conservation and humanitarian organizations; water utility, among others. 

Our Objective: To provide most stable, easy to use, cost effective and robust Geo-IT solutions in collaboration with our worldwide partners in Geospatial, IT, urban planning, aerial mapping and navigation industries. 

Our Vision: To be a leading company of choice in the dispensation of Geospatial solutions in Kenya and Africa at large.

Our Mission: To create, demonstrate & deliver Geospatial technologies and solutions using cutting edge technology to enhance the quality of human life in all spheres of the society.
